{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Segoe UI;}{\f1 Consolas;}}{\colortbl ;\red49\green139\blue59;}\f0\fs20 \pard\sb140\sa80\b\cf1\fs30 Privacy Policy\b0\cf0\fs20\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sa60 {\i Effective Date: September 2026}\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sa60 This software is engineered with strict respect for your digital privacy and operates on a privacy-by-design basis.\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sa100\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sb140\sa80\b\cf1\fs24 1. Data Controller\b0\cf0\fs20\par \pard\sa60 The controller responsible for data processing in connection with the communication channels of this project within the meaning of the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) is:\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sa60 {\b Sven Klocke (sksdesign | complicatiion)}  \par \pard\sa60 c/o Online-Impressum #6936  \par \pard\sa60 Europaring 90  \par \pard\sa60 53757 Sankt Augustin, Germany  \par \pard\sa60 Email: info@sksdesign.de  \par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sa100\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sb140\sa80\b\cf1\fs24 2. Local and Offline Operation of the Software\b0\cf0\fs20\par \pard\sa60 \u8226? {\b Fully Local Processing:} Once downloaded, this software operates locally on your device. All data generation, file processing, and configuration storage occur exclusively on your local machine.\par \pard\sa60 \u8226? {\b No Data Collection or Telemetry:} The application does {\b not} collect, store, process, or transmit any personally identifiable information (PII), usage metrics, crash reports, or telemetry data to the developer or any third party.\par \pard\sa60 \u8226? {\b No Third-Party Tracking or CDNs:} No external Content Delivery Networks (CDNs), remote web fonts, advertising SDKs, analytics frameworks, or tracking tools are embedded or utilized within the software.\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sa100\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sb140\sa80\b\cf1\fs24 3. Repository Hosting on GitHub\b0\cf0\fs20\par \pard\sa60 Please note that while the software itself collects no data, the source code and binary releases are hosted on {\b GitHub} (operated by GitHub, Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. St, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA / GitHub B.V., Vijzelstraat 68-72, 1017 HL Amsterdam, Netherlands).  \par \pard\sa60 When you access this repository, download releases, open issues, or submit pull requests on GitHub, GitHub processes technical connection data (such as your IP address, browser metadata, and account activity) under its own responsibility. For details, please refer to the official GitHub Privacy Statement (https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement).\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sa100\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sb140\sa80\b\cf1\fs24 4. External Links and Social Media Profiles\b0\cf0\fs20\par \pard\sa60 This software or its documentation may contain standard hyperlinks to external websites or portfolio profiles (such as GitHub, {\f1 sksdesign.de}, ArtStation, DeviantArt, YouTube, or similar platforms).  \par \pard\sa60 These are passive links only\u8212?no social media plugins or tracking scripts are loaded within the software. Personal data (such as your IP address) is only transmitted to the external operator if you actively click on an external link, which opens in your default system browser. From that moment on, the privacy policy of the respective website operator applies.\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sa100\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sb140\sa80\b\cf1\fs24 5. Contact via Email or Contact Routing Link\b0\cf0\fs20\par \pard\sa60 If you contact the developer via email ({\f1 mailto:} link) or via the external legal notice contact form ({\f1 mein.online-impressum.de}), the personal data you voluntarily provide (such as your email address, name, and message content) will be processed solely for the purpose of handling and responding to your inquiry.\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sa60 \u8226? {\b Legal Basis:} Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interest in answering user and community inquiries) or Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR (if the inquiry relates to licensing terms).\par \pard\sa60 \u8226? {\b Data Retention:} Your inquiry data is deleted as soon as your request has been conclusively answered, provided no statutory retention requirements apply.\par \pard\sa60 \u8226? {\b Objection to Unsolicited Marketing:} The use of contact data published in our statutory legal notice for sending unsolicited advertising, spam, or marketing materials is strictly prohibited.\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sa100\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sb140\sa80\b\cf1\fs24 6. Your Statutory Rights under the GDPR\b0\cf0\fs20\par \pard\sa60 If your personal data is processed (e.g., when you contact the developer via email), you have the following rights under the GDPR:\par \pard\sa60 \u8226? {\b Right of Access (Art. 15 GDPR):} Request information about your processed personal data.\par \pard\sa60 \u8226? {\b Right to Rectification (Art. 16 GDPR):} Request correction of inaccurate data.\par \pard\sa60 \u8226? {\b Right to Erasure (Art. 17 GDPR):} Request deletion of your data, unless legal obligations require retention.\par \pard\sa60 \u8226? {\b Right to Restriction of Processing (Art. 18 GDPR):} Request restricted processing of your data.\par \pard\sa60 \u8226? {\b Right to Data Portability (Art. 20 GDPR) & Right to Object (Art. 21 GDPR):} Object to data processing based on legitimate interests.\par \pard\sa60 \u8226? {\b Right to Lodge a Complaint (Art. 77 GDPR):} You have the right to lodge a complaint with a competent data protection supervisory authority.\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sa100\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sb140\sa80\b\cf1\fs24 7. Third-Party Trademarks, Fan Works & Non-Commercial Nature\b0\cf0\fs20\par \pard\sa60 All third-party product names, titles, brand names, logos, and company names mentioned in documentation or example assets remain the property of their respective owners. Their mention is strictly for identification, interoperability, or descriptive reference.  \par \pard\sa60 This software is a private, non-commercial open-source project and does not constitute a commercial service offering.\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sa100\par \pard\sa60 \par \pard\sb140\sa80\b\cf1\fs24 8. General Privacy Information & Updates\b0\cf0\fs20\par \pard\sa60 This Privacy Policy may be updated if the software introduces optional network features in future versions. For general privacy disclosures regarding the author's web presence, please visit: https://sksdesign.de/privacy.html (https://sksdesign.de/privacy.html)\par }